<Layout title="Privacy" description="How this Kitty Kelly website preview handles audio, external videos and contact enquiries."><article class="section reading-page"><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITE INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy, <em>simply.</em></h1><p>This is a client-review website proposal for Kitty Kelly. It uses publicly available portfolio material from her current website.</p><h2>Contact enquiries</h2><p>The brief builder prepares a message in your own email application. Form entries are not sent to or stored by this website. You decide whether to send the email. Please avoid adding sensitive personal information.</p><h2>Audio, video and external sites</h2><p>Voice demos, photography and fonts are served with this website. Portfolio films load from Squarespace or YouTube only when you choose to play them. These video providers and external sites such as Spotlight and Audible apply their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Analytics and hosting</h2><p>This prototype does not add analytics, advertising cookies or tracking pixels. The hosting provider may process standard technical request information to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For enquiries about Kitty’s work, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:kittykellyvo@outlook.com">kittykellyvo@outlook.com</a>.</p></article></Layout>

